{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32208","headline":"寄清源寺僧 · 温庭筠","name":"寄清源寺僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石路无尘竹径开，昔年曾伴戴顒来。\n窗间半偈闻钟後，松下残棊送客回。\n帘向玉峰藏夜雪，砌因蓝水长秋苔。\n白莲社裹如相问，爲说游人是姓雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}